docs {
Ganti screenshot satu akun sosial pengajuan pending (20-api-verifier-application.md, issue #50).
Admin/root saja; hanya status pending. Byte gambar tidak lewat worker:
upload dulu ke ImageKit via GET /api/v1/admin/images/upload-token?folder=/verifier-applications,
lalu PATCH dengan url + provider_file_id hasil upload.
Index di luar daftar -> 404 SOCIAL_LINK_NOT_FOUND. Sudah decided -> 409.
}

meta {
  name: Patch Verifier Application Screenshot
  seq: 8
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/verifier-applications/{{verifier_application_id}}/social-links/0/screenshot
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {"url":"https://ik.imagekit.io/sambasku/verifier-applications/budi-v2.jpg","provider_file_id":"file_va_budi_v2"}
}

tests {
  test("200 + screenshot berganti", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.social_links[0].screenshot.provider_file_id).to.equal("file_va_budi_v2");
  });
}
